This package builds on and maintains topic/parameter compatibility with
Intel RealSense software distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
- Intel librealsense (https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense)
  Camera projection, distortion, and depth-to-color alignment math reference.
- Intel realsense-ros (https://github.com/IntelRealSense/realsense-ros)
  ROS 2 topic, frame, CameraInfo, and parameter naming conventions.
